Chapter: ShowText
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 show on a Text value returns the text itself (identity), not a
 formatted pointer. show on Integer and Boolean stay as before.

Section: Opening

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show "hello")
    print-line-uni (show 42)
    print-line-uni (show True)
  end

